{"id":"word:hebrew:H4713","type":"word","title":"מִצְרִי","subtitle":"H4713 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a Mitsrite , or inhabitant of Mitsrajim","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מִצְרִי (H4713) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: a.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 76 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מִצְרִי (Mitsrîy) means a Mitsrite , or inhabitant of Mitsrajim First listed occurrence: 1Chr 2 34."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מִצְרִי","transliteration":"Mitsrîy","pronunciation":"mits-ree'","strong":"H4713","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4713","partOfSpeech":"a","forms":["מִצְרַ֔יִם","מִצְרַ֨יִם֙","מִצְרַ֖יִם","מִצְרִ֔י","מִצְרָ֑יִם"],"morphs":[["HNp",42],["HTd/Ngmsa",10],["HNgmsa",9],["HTd/Ngmpa",5],["HTd/Ngfsa",3],["HR/Np",3],["HTd/Ngfpa",1],["HNgfsa",1],["HC/Rd/Ngmpa",1],["HC/Np",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a Mitsrite , or inhabitant of Mitsrajim","usage":"Egyptian, of Egypt.","full":"H4713. Mitsri מִצְרִי adjective, of a people Egyptian ; — masculine singular ׳מ Gen 39:1 16 t.; feminine singular מִעְרִית 16:1 3 t.; masculine plural מִצְרִים 12:12 5 t.; feminine plural מִצְרִיֹּת Exod 1:19 ; &#8212; 1 adjective מ ׳אִישׁ = an Egyptian Gen 39:1 ; Exod 2:11 , 19 ; Lev 24:10 ; 1Sam 30:11 ; 2Sam 23:30 ; הַמּ ׳הָאִישׁ 1Chr 11:23 ; מ ׳נָעָר 1Sam 30:13 , מ ׳עֶבֶד 1Chr 2:34 ; מִצְרִית שִׁפְחָה Gen 16:1 , הַמִּצְרִיֹּת כַּנָּשִׁים Exod 1:19 . 2 with article = substantive the Egyptian Gen 39:2 , 5 ; Exod 2:12 , 14 ; 2Sam 23:30 (twice in verse); 1Chr 11:23 (twice in verse); so once without article מִצְרִי Deut 23:8 ; הַמִּצְרִי once (late) collective= the Egyptians Ezra 9:1 (where with Canaanitish peoples); plural = the Egyptians , הַמִּצְרִים Gen 12:12 , 14 ; 43:22 ; Deut 26:6 ; Josh 24:7 ; feminine singular הַמִּצְרִית הָגָּר Hagar the Egyptian woman Gen 16:3 ; 21:9 ; 25:12 . [ מְצֻרָה ] see [ מְצוּרָה ] below I. צור . מַצְרֵף vide צרף . [ מַצֻּת ] see מַצּוּת below נצה . מָק מַק, see מקק . I, II. מַקֶּ֫בֶת see נקב .","rootNote":"from 4714 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 2 34","keyReferences":["1Chr 2 34","1Chr 11 23","1Chr 11 23","1Chr 11 23","1Sam 6 6","1Sam 30 11","1Sam 30 13","2Sam 23 21"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":76,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 2 34","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִצְרִ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNgmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 11 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּצְרִ֜י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ngmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 11 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּצְרִ֤י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ngmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 11 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּצְרִ֔י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ngmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 6 6","book":"1Sam","chapter":6,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִצְרַ֥יִם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Sam 30 11","book":"1Sam","chapter":30,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִצְרִי֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNgmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 30 13","book":"1Sam","chapter":30,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִצְרִ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNgmsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 23 21","book":"2Sam","chapter":23,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִצְרִ֜י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNgmsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 23 21","book":"2Sam","chapter":23,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּצְרִי֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ngmsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 23 21","book":"2Sam","chapter":23,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּצְרִ֔י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ngmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 23 8","book":"Deut","chapter":23,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִצְרִ֔י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNgmsa"},{"re